{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "WEBSTER1833",
  "book_code": "PRO",
  "chapter": 28,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "PRO.28.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.28.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The wicked flee when no man pursueth: but the righteous are bold as a lion.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.28.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.28.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For the transgression of a land many ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " its princes: but by a man of understanding ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " knowledge the state ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "thereof",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " shall be prolonged.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.28.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.28.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A poor man that oppresseth the poor ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is like",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a sweeping rain which leaveth no food.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.28.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.28.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They that forsake the law praise the wicked: but such as keep the law contend with them.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.28.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.28.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Evil men understand not judgment: but they that seek the LORD understand all ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "things",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.28.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.28.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Better ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the poor that walketh in his uprightness, than ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "he that is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " perverse ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "in his",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " ways, though he ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " rich.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.28.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.28.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He who keepeth the law ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a wise son: but he that is a companion of riotous ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "men",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " shameth his father.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.28.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.28.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He that by usury and unjust gain increaseth his substance, he shall gather it for him that will pity the poor.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.28.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.28.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He that turneth away his ear from hearing the law, even his prayer ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "shall be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " abomination.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.28.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.28.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Whoever causeth the righteous to go astray in an evil way, he shall fall himself into his own pit: but the upright shall have good ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "things",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in possession.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.28.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.28.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The rich man ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " wise in his own conceit; but the poor man that hath understanding searcheth him out.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.28.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.28.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "When righteous ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "men",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " rejoice, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "there is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " great glory: but when the wicked rise, a man is hidden.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.28.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.28.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He that covereth his sins shall not prosper: but he who confesseth and forsaketh ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "them",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " shall have mercy.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.28.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.28.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Happy ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the man that feareth always: but he that hardeneth his heart shall fall into mischief.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.28.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.28.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "As",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a roaring lion, and a ranging bear; ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "so is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a wicked ruler over the poor people.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.28.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.28.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The prince that wanteth understanding ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " also a great oppressor: ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "but",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " he that hateth covetousness shall prolong ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "his",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " days.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.28.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.28.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A man that doeth violence to the blood of ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "any",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " person shall flee to the pit; let no man stay him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.28.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.28.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He who walketh uprightly shall be saved: but ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "he that is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " perverse ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "in his",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " ways shall fall at once.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.28.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.28.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He that tilleth his land shall have plenty of bread: but he that followeth after vain ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "persons",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " shall have poverty enough.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.28.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.28.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A faithful man shall abound with blessings: but he that maketh haste to be rich shall not be innocent.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.28.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.28.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "To have respect of persons ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " not good: for, for a piece of bread ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "that",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " man will transgress.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.28.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.28.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He that hasteth to be rich ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "hath",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " an evil eye, and considereth not that poverty shall come upon him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.28.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.28.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He that rebuketh a man afterward shall find more favor than he that flattereth with the tongue.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.28.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.28.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He that robbeth his father or his mother, and saith, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "It is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " no transgression; the same ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the companion of a destroyer.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.28.25",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.28.25",
      "verse": 25,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He that is of a proud heart stirreth up strife: but he that putteth his trust in the LORD shall be made fat.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.28.26",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.28.26",
      "verse": 26,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He that trusteth in his own heart is a fool: but whoever walketh wisely, he shall be delivered.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.28.27",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.28.27",
      "verse": 27,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He that giveth to the poor shall not want: but he that hideth his eyes shall have many a curse.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.28.28",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.28.28",
      "verse": 28,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "When the wicked rise, men hide themselves: but when they perish, the righteous increase.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
